{"repositoryId":1418254834,"availability":"available","full":"ebxc-7s13/somm","name":"somm","description":"SOMM — Sound of My Mind: map your music, discover your sound, find your people. Music Map, evidence-backed taste insights, music communities (Trees), playlist-to-CSV converter. Web app + Android APK.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-14T02:23:31Z","updated":"2026-10-18T12:11:00Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://soundofmymind.onrender.com","topics":["android","capacitor","community","music","music-discovery","musicbrainz","playlist-converter","postgresql","pwa","react","typescript","webrtc"],"demo":"https://soundofmymind.onrender.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.069Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.069Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.069Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.069Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["You Are What You Consume · A Social Mind for Audiophiles","SOMM turns a playlist into an interactive Music Map of your musical identity, explains what your library says about your taste — with the evidence and the source behind every statement — and connects you with listeners whose maps genuinely overlap yours in music-based communities called Trees, each with its own shared map and chat.","It is a music-intelligence and community app, not a player or a generic social network: SOMM never streams or stores audio, never asks for your Spotify/YouTube/Apple password, and never builds psychological or demographic profiles."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ebxc-7s13/somm/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"64e2fe6c62413e0885d31da9c9f7016de2c0a66e16a4e10bf3feb5cd2fd531cc","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.155Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.155Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"You Are What You Consume · A Social Mind for Audiophil